{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1000_p", "source_sha256": "31d7e5b19594b57952e26bdffb3ca0687118a57e6d2b476a9106b4cc8d791cb5", "ja": "（アイドルが洋服をプロデュースする企画。\n今回デザインを担当したのはひなただ）", "zh": "（这是一个由偶像负责设计服装的企划。这次负责设计的是日向。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "9ad32b3d729df4c8394f37d92cbc4f0138515ba7905f3252350d30dee5d8ac17", "ja": "どうだろう、{$P$}。\nみんなが喜んでくれるような服にできたかなぁ？", "zh": "怎么样，{$P$}。\n做出的衣服能让大家开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8dd22db40e7e9d29c9b5b4daec44e1ad3a85621edf2b55bdd87a3310a6814084", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだよ。\n可愛らしさが出てて、みんなも喜ぶと思う。", "zh": "嗯，完全没问题。\n可爱感也展现出来了，我想大家都会喜欢的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "ca86810d67df9a99f4bbfc8c21f46d3ae61035bd246e0f6821e49ddf32682ac9", "ja": "わぁ、本当かい？　{$P$}に\nそう言ってもらえると、ホッとするべさ。", "zh": "哇，真的吗？听{$P$}\n这么说，我就安心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "e3977a202135934a37375d150e6675777560a8ab68eb0ddca8f47fd9a0f79487", "ja": "実はねぇ、ちょっこし不安だったんだわ。本当に、\nあたしが考えたデザインで大丈夫なのかって。", "zh": "其实呢，我之前还有点不安呢。\n一直在想由我来设计的方案真的没问题吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "cde5585e5513c88cdcaac1bf7b88302d55305e93a0c567f10d8dfde96e239c35", "ja": "その前のテーマ決めも……時間がかかってしまったし。\nだから、どんな風に仕上がるか心配だったんだぁ。", "zh": "之前决定主题的时候也……花了不少时间。\n所以我一直担心最后会做成什么样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1006_p", "source_sha256": "af70b2bfce37ed836708efb302ef631f513fc5533f272da8f19158277e16670f", "ja": "テーマか……『北海道でも着られる、ぽかぽかした服』\nだったな。ひなたらしくていいテーマだと思うよ。", "zh": "主题啊……是“在北海道也能穿的暖和衣服”吧。我觉得这是个很有日向风格的好主题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "1c07ac464d1c964691eba4d88bd57a5918ee293187581ade3001f52a9196d593", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとさんです。テーマで悩んでる時……\nたまたま、家族から電話がかかってきてねぇ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你。当我为主题苦恼的时候……正好家里打来了电话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "8e251cf8d7c9b21703ede8c835c617a5d371745121b1af60e3ab97e9cf952b47", "ja": "みんなの話を聞いてると、地元の景色が浮かんできて\n……だんだん、心があったかくなってきたんだ。", "zh": "听着大家说话，老家的景色就浮现在了眼前\n……心里也渐渐变得暖洋洋的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "72a5954d9a6db261fa62f59fc715beeb14de913bcee392c0d903e1d69d1cfedc", "ja": "電話が終わった後も、ぽかぽかしてて……。\nこの気持ちを、服にできたらいいなぁって。", "zh": "打完电话以后，心里还是暖乎乎的……要是能把这种心情做成衣服就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9519a8df09d97e08c2914a387ea6ac36218706c59a8feaf0dbd1aa98d84b4d1d", "ja": "なるほどな。それで、温かそうなデザインなのか。", "zh": "原来如此。难怪设计得看起来这么暖和。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "6820bb9cc6643d6c9c5b7cb33f1500c27136fbde891a9508d7dc8de3bdb4d65c", "ja": "うん。それにね、みんながこの服を着て、大好きな\n北海道に行ってくれたら、あたしもうれしいべさ。", "zh": "嗯。而且呢，大家要是能穿着这身衣服，\n去我最喜欢的北海道，我也会很高兴的呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1012_p", "source_sha256": "0345b7ab4870afc615f5ae6a7577eeb34410917d2ae4690be84243bc0a7a57da", "ja": "そうだな。北海道で写真を撮る人がいたら……\nいや、待てよ。", "zh": "是啊。要是有人穿着这身衣服在北海道拍照的话……\n不对，等等。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1013_p", "source_sha256": "deeaa3929af14a626055dc4f1b2fb2b281d3ab5c15a87129889194a72c78a61b", "ja": "例えばひなたが、北海道のいろんな場所で\n写真を撮ったら、話題になるんじゃないか？", "zh": "比如让日向在北海道各地拍些照片，说不定会成为热门话题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "6e095e94bf99644dfc6805566c9bed33486eea44cdb973d92a63fd10c90dbc2d", "ja": "わぁ、それは素敵だねぇ。ファンのみんなに、\n北海道のいいところを案内してあげられるよぉ。", "zh": "哇，那一定很棒呢。这样就能带粉丝们\n领略北海道的美好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3c6595bc68251feb77ef015537cd7c71e2eb1f4878e97ef3e5a27b76012b2833", "ja": "そうだな。ひなたが楽しそうにしていたら、\nきっと行ってみたいって思う人も出て来るはずだよ。", "zh": "是啊。要是小日向玩得很开心，肯定也会有人因此想去看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "36808e9a2702c04725a64060dbae3a8af19013e24815ddf88b265f92dff73ebb", "ja": "想像しただけで、楽しい気持ちになるねぇ。\nみんなが笑顔になってる姿を……。", "zh": "光是想象一下，就让人觉得很开心呢。\n大家都露出笑容的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "6000964fb8e2c86de933ecee91c757214992562b150e3d1bc681d639027f6804", "ja": "あたしは実現してくれたら、うれしいんだけども……\n難しいだろか、{$P$}？", "zh": "要是能实现的话，我会很开心的，不过……是不是很难呀，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1018_p", "source_sha256": "86aa8fae6080a1d55dcb6cdef4a9e372aafd60d1249c56b4ca47a1f5d6f077df", "ja": "ちょうど、服のアピール方法を模索しててね。\n早速検討しよう！　ひなたも一緒に考えてくれるか？", "zh": "正好，我正在摸索宣传服装的方法呢。\n我们马上来研究一下吧！日向也一起想想，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0554_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0554_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "53e6f2924f07744b2a06ff089c5c17714e781709dafb6e8ca8811d9bf851463a", "ja": "もちろんだよぉ。あたしも、ちゃんと北海道の魅力を\n伝えられるようがんばるべさ♪", "zh": "那是当然啦。我也会好好努力，\n把北海道的魅力传达给大家的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
